WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.396 --> 00:00:04.886
Unit eighteen. Cultural Identity and Diversity!

2
00:00:06.025 --> 00:00:11.073
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Sophea. Welcome back!

3
00:00:11.123 --> 00:00:14.702
Hi, Teacher Sophea! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.752 --> 00:00:19.822
Today we learn: Cultural Identity and Diversity. Let's go!

5
00:00:20.962 --> 00:00:26.112
Cultural identity. Say it with me. Cultural identity!

6
00:00:29.636 --> 00:00:33.636
Diversity. Say it with me. Diversity!

7
00:00:37.109 --> 00:00:41.059
Heritage. Say it with me. Heritage!

8
00:00:44.542 --> 00:00:48.376
Tolerance. Say it with me. Tolerance!

9
00:00:51.896 --> 00:00:55.963
Perspective. Say it with me. Perspective!

10
00:00:59.463 --> 00:01:03.080
Tradition. Say it with me. Tradition!

11
00:01:06.596 --> 00:01:10.462
Inclusive. Say it with me. Inclusive!

12
00:01:13.952 --> 00:01:18.335
Belonging. Say it with me. Belonging!

13
00:01:21.826 --> 00:01:30.666
Grammar time! Shaped by... Listen. My identity is shaped by my family's traditions.

14
00:01:30.716 --> 00:01:36.763
Your turn. Say it with me. My identity is shaped by my family's traditions.

15
00:01:41.930 --> 00:02:00.824
Cultural identity shapes how we see the world, built from our heritage, traditions, and personal experiences. Living in a diverse society means encountering many different perspectives, which requires tolerance and an inclusive mindset. True belonging comes from respecting both our own identity and others'.

16
00:02:00.874 --> 00:02:02.228
I like this story!

17
00:02:02.949 --> 00:02:08.366
Look! What's the word?

18
00:02:08.416 --> 00:02:09.566
Heritage!

19
00:02:10.616 --> 00:02:15.974
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:16.024 --> 00:02:17.277
Inclusive!

21
00:02:18.644 --> 00:02:27.534
Think and answer. What part of your cultural heritage are you most proud of?

22
00:02:27.584 --> 00:02:28.734
Great answer!

23
00:02:29.813 --> 00:02:32.908
This unit's value is Respect for Diversity.

24
00:02:32.958 --> 00:02:35.406
I can show respect for diversity every day!

25
00:02:36.111 --> 00:02:40.362
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

26
00:02:40.412 --> 00:02:41.950
Bye-bye, friends!

